abstract: >-
  Reproducible polynomial-Gaussian Fourier identities, high-precision reference
  vectors, numerical quadrature cross-checks, constrained finite-dimensional
  Rayleigh-Ritz diagnostics, analytic spatial-tail bounds, and finite
  arithmetic experiments under an explicit Fourier convention.
